          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports gradually increasing, symmetrical pitting ankle oedema for approximately 5–6 days; a dent remains for a few seconds. Worse in the evening, especially after prolonged sitting, and better in the morning after leg elevation."
      }
    },
